            <h3>ZingTalk Privacy Policy</h3>
            <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026 | <strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 2026</p>
            <p>This Privacy Policy explains how ZingTalk ("we", "our", or "us"), owned and published by <strong>KM Mamata</strong>, collects, protects, and handles information across our applications on Amazon Fire TV, Android devices, and web portals.</p>

            <h4>1. Information We Collect</h4>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>User Identity & Credentials:</strong> When you register an account or create a profile, we store your chosen username, email address (for recovery), and an assigned unique 10-digit User ID (UID).</li>
                <li><strong>Real-Time Signaling:</strong> To establish audio and video connections, session signaling data (SDP offers/answers and ICE candidates) is routed through secure WebSockets.</li>
                <li><strong>Zero Call Recording:</strong> We do NOT intercept, store, record, or inspect any live audio or video stream. Peer-to-peer streams are encrypted.</li>
            </ul>

            <h4>2. Advertising & Analytics Disclosures (InMobi & Partners)</h4>
            <p>We work with trusted third-party advertising networks, such as InMobi, to display relevant advertisements within the free tiers of our applications. These partners may collect device identifiers (such as Google Advertising ID or Amazon Fire Advertising ID), IP addresses, and non-sensitive technical data to serve non-intrusive, interest-based or contextual ads in compliance with applicable laws.</p>

            <h4>3. Children's Privacy (COPPA)</h4>
            <p>ZingTalk does not knowingly solicit or collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe a minor has registered without parental consent, please contact us immediately for prompt deletion.</p>

            <h4>4. Data Security</h4>
            <p>All server communication is strictly enforced via HTTPS/WSS (TLS 1.3) with encrypted token storage and secure Firebase Authentication.</p>
